# Links lychee should not verify.
#
# The demo gif is a build artifact, rendered from cmd/inspector/demo.tape at
# release time and attached to the release by goreleaser (release.extra_files).
# It is never committed, so the README links it as a release asset at a fixed
# releases/latest/download/demo.gif URL.
#
# That URL 404s until a release actually carries the asset. Every release from
# v0.0.10 onward failed on a dirty tree, so no release has one yet. Once a
# release succeeds this line can go, and a broken demo link becomes a real
# failure again.
https://github\.com/jarvisfriends/inspector/releases/latest/download/demo\.gif$
